#: build/admin/tax.js:8
msgid "Round the tax of each line"
msgstr ""

#: build/admin/tax.js:8
msgid "Each item’s tax is rounded to the cent and the rounded amounts added up, as some accounting systems expect. Otherwise each rate is rounded once over the whole order, which is closer to the exact tax; the two can differ by a cent."
msgstr ""

